3. gen_metric_1 Is the Heaviest Tested Operator

Configuration size

gen_metric_1 contains 78 metrics, the largest population in this six-operator group.

Observed execution

• Approximate runtime: ~105 minutes
• Stage 1: 50 minutes
• Stage 2: 45 minutes
• Stage 1 shuffle read: 1,123.1 GiB
• Stage 1 shuffle write: 1,347.0 GiB
• Stage 2 shuffle read: 1,372.9 GiB
• Stage 2 memory spill: 151.5 GiB
• Stage 2 disk spill: 10.4 GiB
• Stage 2 median task: 51 seconds
• Stage 2 maximum task: 39 minutes
• Stage 2 median shuffle read: 69.4 MiB
