Interpretation

gen_metric_1 is expensive across both downstream stages.

It has the longest Stage 1 and the highest final-stage shuffle and spill figures of the six tested operators.

This makes gen_metric_1 the first operator that should be reviewed in detail by Engineering / Data Science.

However, it should not be treated as the only problem because the same expensive Stage 2 pattern appears independently in several other operators.

